            <ArticleTitle>[Hemodynamic disorders in patients with ischemic heart disease after aortocoronary bypass during transportation from the operating room to intensive care units and their prevention].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>16-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Changes in homeostasis of 33 coronary patients after aortocoronary shunting, developing in the course of transportation of the patients to reanimation department, were studied. The causes of some shifts in the homeostasis were revealed. Methods for the prevention and therapy of these disorders were developed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
